 ## Architecture Overview[m
 [m
 ```[m
[31m-WhatsApp Webview Page (Host Bot)[m
[31m-       │  (Chat icon links to chat UI with ?user_id=...)[m
[32m+[m[32mWhatsApp Webview Page / Browser (Mobile & Desktop)[m
[32m+[m[32m       │  (Accesses /chat/ with bilingual English | मराठी UI)[m
        ▼[m
[31m-Chat UI (Standalone mobile-first web page, Phase 5)[m
[31m-       │  HTTPS + JSON (X-API-Key header)[m
[32m+[m[32mMobile-First Chat UI (Served at /chat/)[m
[32m+[m[32m       │  HTTPS + JSON (English/Marathi query, language parameter)[m
        ▼[m
[31m-FastAPI Backend (Phase 2)[m
[31m-       ├── Security & Auth (X-API-Key, PDF magic-bytes & size validation)[m
[31m-       ├── Document Registry (SQLite metadata store)[m
[31m-       ├── PDF Loader      (PyMuPDF, OCR fallback with Tesseract)[m
[31m-       ├── Chunker         (Page-aware character chunking)[m
[31m-       ├── Embedder        (multilingual-e5 via sentence-transformers)[m
[31m-       ├── Vector Store    (ChromaDB persistent on disk, cosine distance)[m
[31m-       └── LLM Client      (Provider-agnostic wrapper, default Gemini)[m
[32m+[m[32mFastAPI Backend[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── Security & Auth (X-API-Key, admin PDF validation)[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── Official Document Registry (SQLite tracking active document & indexing status)[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── Admin Ingestion (CLI & REST: page-by-page extraction, batched embeddings, safe replacement)[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── PDF Loader      (PyMuPDF with Tesseract OCR fallback for scanned pages)[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── Chunker         (Page-aware character chunking & OCR flag preservation)[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── Embedder        (multilingual-e5 via sentence-transformers, batch-processed)[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── Vector Store    (ChromaDB persistent on disk, cosine distance, tenant-isolated)[m
[32m+[m[32m       ├── Retrieval & Fallback Coordinator (Three-tier: Grounded -> General LLM fallback -> 503)[m
[32m+[m[32m       └── LLM Client      (Provider-agnostic wrapper, default Gemini 3.8-flash)[m
 ```[m
